  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1XBFgio.png\" alt=\"遊戲中顯示此模組彩虹橡樹範例的 Minecraft 截圖。它們看起來像是生物群系葉塊所在地的彩虹光譜。\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>來自暮色森林模組的彩虹橡樹。只是樹木…但出現在主世界。就這麼簡單。這就是這個模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>You can also find this on <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=%E6%94%B9%E7%89%B9%E5%8A%A0%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fmodrinth.com%2Fproject%2Frainbow-oaks-3%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JiMtLSY.png\" alt=\"Examples\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLPwXq0.png\" alt=\"Big tree example\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組的先前版本：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rainbow-oak-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rainbow-oak-trees</a>（適用於 1.10-1.12，目前已從 CurseForge 移除）<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rainbow-oak-trees-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rainbow-oak-trees-2</a>（MC 1.17-1.19.3）  </p>\n<p>特別感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/benimatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Benimatic</a> 的原創 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> 模組，以及目前維護該團隊的支持！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
